       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MSTCHK.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT EXPENSE-MASTER ASSIGN TO EXPVSAM
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS MASTER-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FS-VSAM.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD EXPENSE-MASTER.
       01 MASTER-RECORD.
          05 MASTER-KEY PIC X(12).
          05 FILLER PIC X(68).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 FS-VSAM PIC XX.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           OPEN I-O EXPENSE-MASTER
           DISPLAY 'MASTER OPEN STATUS=' FS-VSAM
           IF FS-VSAM NOT = '00'
               MOVE 12 TO RETURN-CODE
           END-IF
           IF FS-VSAM = '00'
               CLOSE EXPENSE-MASTER
           END-IF
           GOBACK.
